From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Subject: [PATCH] console: disable input and output when configured

Set the runtime flag before the console starts printing. Enabling
CONFIG_DISABLE_CONSOLE alone only builds the flag checks.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [layer production policy]
Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
---
 common/console.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/common/console.c b/common/console.c
--- a/common/console.c
+++ b/common/console.c
@@ -1025,6 +1025,9 @@ static bool console_update_silent(void)
 /* Called before relocation - use serial functions */
 int console_init_f(void)
 {
+	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DISABLE_CONSOLE))
+		gd->flags |= GD_FLG_DISABLE_CONSOLE;
+
 	gd->flags |= GD_FLG_HAVE_CONSOLE;
 
 	console_update_silent();
